I'll take the money back.

589
00:34:59,860 --> 00:35:01,080
We'll cancel the other two matches.

590
00:35:01,780 --> 00:35:02,240
Fine.

591
00:35:02,620 --> 00:35:03,240
It's a deal.

592
00:35:04,540 --> 00:35:05,200
Bring me the wine.

593
00:35:08,540 --> 00:35:09,620
You want me to lose again?

594
00:35:10,200 --> 00:35:10,660
I'm a 7-year-old.

595
00:35:10,920 --> 00:35:11,400
I'm a 18-year-old.

596
00:35:11,560 --> 00:35:12,960
I'm the champion of Hong Kong.

597
00:35:14,980 --> 00:35:16,480
Why do you have to be bullied in Thailand?

598
00:35:19,400 --> 00:35:20,040
I train hard.

599
00:35:20,700 --> 00:35:21,140
I work hard.

600
00:35:21,680 --> 00:35:22,440
I fight with all my might.

601
00:35:23,380 --> 00:35:25,760
But they use guns against me.

602
00:35:25,900 --> 00:35:27,040
They decide to defeat me.

603
00:35:27,480 --> 00:35:28,220
I'm so tired.

604
00:35:28,580 --> 00:35:29,160
I broke my bones,

605
00:35:29,560 --> 00:35:29,900
I hurt my tendons,

606
00:35:30,300 --> 00:35:30,940
I cut my muscles.

607
00:35:31,580 --> 00:35:32,800
I've never cried out of pain.

608
00:35:40,540 --> 00:35:41,180
It's all over now.

609
00:35:41,720 --> 00:35:42,780
Even you tell me to listen to them.

610
00:35:44,060 --> 00:35:45,500
I'll be fighting in the ring.

611
00:35:45,520 --> 00:35:46,400
How many more matches can I play?

612
00:35:46,540 --> 00:35:47,640
How many more games can I lose?

613
00:35:49,300 --> 00:35:50,380
I'm in the top 8.

614
00:35:50,920 --> 00:35:51,720
I can't lose.

615
00:35:52,340 --> 00:35:53,620
Who knows I'm in the bottom?

616
00:35:59,930 --> 00:36:01,490
You're not a clown.

617
00:36:02,030 --> 00:36:03,970
Unless you think of yourself as a clown.

618
00:36:06,470 --> 00:36:07,170
I am.

619
00:36:08,310 --> 00:36:08,550
I am.

620
00:36:08,550 --> 00:36:09,390
I'm a clown.

621
00:36:09,770 --> 00:36:10,590
I'm a fool.

622
00:36:13,600 --> 00:36:16,780
Who knows what my real skill is?

623
00:36:17,420 --> 00:36:18,540
I know.

624
00:36:19,240 --> 00:36:20,140
I found you in the alley.

625
00:36:20,520 --> 00:36:21,450
I found you in the alley.

626
00:36:22,980 --> 00:36:23,920
I found you in the alley.

627
00:36:23,920 --> 00:36:24,900
I'm just a small alley,

628
00:36:24,900 --> 00:36:27,760
a little further away from the other.

629
00:36:27,760 --> 00:36:29,020
Three years ago,

630
00:36:29,020 --> 00:36:32,520
You're not the kind of person you are now.

631
00:36:33,080 --> 00:36:34,160
Three years...

632
00:36:37,170 --> 00:36:39,730
Three years...

633
00:36:39,730 --> 00:36:41,290
You can make a person self-aware.

634
00:36:41,950 --> 00:36:42,730
Self-aware?

635
00:36:44,870 --> 00:36:46,230
Damn self-aware!

636
00:36:46,730 --> 00:36:50,330
You know you're just a street cat in a alley.

637
00:36:50,450 --> 00:36:51,490
You've grown up.

638
00:36:51,930 --> 00:36:53,990
Think about it. You were in a bar.

639
00:36:54,390 --> 00:36:55,990
How could you make up your mind?

640
00:36:56,550 --> 00:36:58,250
You couldn't.

641
00:36:58,430 --> 00:36:59,710
You made up your mind back then.

642
00:36:59,710 --> 00:37:01,570
Now you're playing on the stage.

643
00:37:01,850 --> 00:37:02,430
It's the same as winning or losing.

644
00:37:04,090 --> 00:37:05,050
What's the difference?

645
00:37:06,410 --> 00:37:08,430
Back then, you were just a street cat.

646
00:37:08,850 --> 00:37:09,830
Now you have a lot of problems.

647
00:37:10,770 --> 00:37:12,670
Think about it. You were in a bar.

648
00:37:14,550 --> 00:37:16,230
You love yourself, don't you?

649
00:37:17,430 --> 00:37:18,850
You have to figure it out.

650
00:37:20,730 --> 00:37:21,990
What's the time now?

651
00:37:22,090 --> 00:37:23,510
Can you be so willful?

652
00:37:23,510 --> 00:37:23,730
What's your name?

653
00:37:28,490 --> 00:37:30,550
Three matches left. The contract is over.

654
00:37:31,730 --> 00:37:33,870
I'll turn you into a boxing king.

655
00:37:33,870 --> 00:37:35,010
I'm not a boxing king.

656
00:37:36,390 --> 00:37:38,090
But I have a dream and a ambition.

657
00:37:38,290 --> 00:37:39,390
I want to fight for myself.

658
00:37:39,610 --> 00:37:40,110
I don't want to hurt anyone.

659
00:37:41,370 --> 00:37:42,270
If you want to fight, go ahead.

660
00:37:47,380 --> 00:37:50,280
Tieshan, I'm telling you.

661
00:37:50,440 --> 00:37:51,680
Dreams don't just hang around your mouth.

662
00:37:52,440 --> 00:37:54,780
Sometimes you have to lie, sometimes you have to use a gun.

663
00:37:54,780 --> 00:37:57,660
This is a jungle with no borders.

664
00:37:58,220 --> 00:38:00,740
There are no ideals, only cruel reality.

665
00:38:01,060 --> 00:38:02,760
Whoever wins can live on.

666
00:38:04,300 --> 00:38:05,640
Do you think I'm willing to lose?

667
00:38:06,140 --> 00:38:06,820
It's a joke.

668
00:38:07,240 --> 00:38:08,840
The problem is that my strength is too weak.

669
00:38:09,400 --> 00:38:10,040
I can't do anything about it.

670
00:38:11,000 --> 00:38:12,180
I can only come up with a plan.

671
00:38:12,960 --> 00:38:14,680
If you lose this time, you win freedom.

672
00:38:14,940 --> 00:38:15,380
Do you understand?

673
00:38:16,000 --> 00:38:17,680
Without freedom, you can't survive.

674
00:38:23,420 --> 00:38:24,560
You don't have to fight.

675
00:38:25,020 --> 00:38:27,340
If you have the guts, go to the streets.

676
00:38:27,340 --> 00:38:28,660
You have the guts to fight.

677
00:38:29,720 --> 00:38:32,720
If you don't, you can hide in a bar.

678
00:38:33,000 --> 00:38:34,740
You can die in the hands of a drunkard.

679
00:38:35,400 --> 00:38:38,120
But I'm telling you, I won't give up.

680
00:38:46,300 --> 00:40:05,380
Brother, the company gave me a month's leave to visit Thailand.

681
00:40:05,660 --> 00:40:07,360
I came to see you as soon as I got off the plane.

682
00:40:08,320 --> 00:40:11,220
I was just looking around and I knew he wasn't your match.

683
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:13,100
But I looked around.

684
00:40:13,100 --> 00:40:16,880
There's a pretty girl staring at you.

685
00:40:18,780 --> 00:40:19,940
She must be your fan.

686
00:40:21,000 --> 00:40:22,980
Brother, isn't it?

687
00:40:29,500 --> 00:40:30,900
She's my senior.

688
00:40:31,680 --> 00:40:33,900
Brother, I came to see you.

689
00:40:34,020 --> 00:40:34,960
You can't lose.

690
00:40:37,220 --> 00:40:38,900
Brother, come on!

691
00:40:39,100 --> 00:40:40,460
Let's go, let's go!

692
00:40:40,940 --> 00:40:42,320
Don't look back!

693
00:41:12,340 --> 00:41:15,220
If I don't go forward, you'll have to push me.

694
00:41:16,100 --> 00:41:17,540
Brother, come on!

695
00:41:22,390 --> 00:41:22,430
Come on!

696
00:41:23,130 --> 00:41:26,370
I don't believe he can beat you.

697
00:41:26,370 --> 00:41:27,110
Come on!

698
00:41:59,550 --> 00:43:29,940
What did they say?

699
00:43:33,480 --> 00:43:35,180
They said they didn't believe me.

700
00:43:35,520 --> 00:43:36,900
They all ran away.

701
00:43:45,050 --> 00:43:46,550
Our brothers...

702
00:43:46,550 --> 00:43:48,250
They all betrayed you?

703
00:43:50,030 --> 00:43:50,550
Very good.

704
00:43:51,850 --> 00:43:53,110
What about you?

705
00:43:53,630 --> 00:43:54,690
Will you follow me?

706
00:43:57,550 --> 00:43:58,270
I...

707
00:43:58,270 --> 00:44:00,290
I know this is a matter of life and death.

708
00:44:01,090 --> 00:44:01,250
But I don't want you to die.

709
00:44:01,250 --> 00:44:02,210
How about this?

710
00:44:05,200 --> 00:44:06,880
If you don't want to follow me,

711
00:44:07,520 --> 00:44:09,980
you'll have to go one step forward.

712
00:44:13,700 --> 00:44:15,340
If you don't want to follow me,

713
00:44:15,600 --> 00:44:16,740
you'll have to go one step back.

714
00:44:29,820 --> 00:44:31,140
No one's going to follow you?

715
00:44:32,440 --> 00:44:33,720
Very good.

716
00:44:34,600 --> 00:44:36,460
I...

717
00:44:36,460 --> 00:44:39,020
Listen up, all of you.

718
00:44:39,020 --> 00:44:42,480
Tomorrow morning, we're going to Chin Mai.

719
00:44:42,840 --> 00:44:43,940
We're going to the jungle.

720
00:44:44,400 --> 00:44:45,120
What?

721
00:44:46,840 --> 00:44:49,060
I know what you're thinking.

722
00:44:50,700 --> 00:44:53,400
Because all the roads, the airports,

723
00:44:54,540 --> 00:44:57,320
the docks and the stations...

724
00:44:57,320 --> 00:44:58,680
They're all packed.

725
00:45:00,040 --> 00:45:00,820
There's no other way.

726
00:45:01,120 --> 00:45:02,440
So we have to take this path.

727
00:45:04,600 --> 00:45:07,400
Of course, this path may be a little tough,

728
00:45:07,400 --> 00:45:09,660
but it's absolutely safe.

729
00:45:10,740 --> 00:45:11,920
Bao Bo doesn't dare to hurt me.

730
00:45:11,980 --> 00:45:13,300
Don't worry about that.

731
00:45:14,200 --> 00:45:17,580
But I'm sure he won't let you go.

732
00:45:19,100 --> 00:45:20,940
Once I've taken care of everything here,

733
00:45:21,500 --> 00:45:23,560
I'll go to Chin Mai to pick you up.

734
00:45:24,220 --> 00:45:27,280
But Sister, that forest is a forbidden area.

735
00:45:27,880 --> 00:45:28,380
There are people from the Lietou tribe.

736
00:45:29,180 --> 00:45:30,060
Don't worry about that.

737
00:45:30,540 --> 00:45:32,560
Although they're not open-minded,

738
00:45:32,800 --> 00:45:34,220
they're much worse than Bao Bo.

739
00:45:37,400 --> 00:45:38,420
As long as we don't mess with them,

740
00:45:38,560 --> 00:45:40,120
we'll be fine.

741
00:45:41,200 --> 00:45:42,820
But snakes don't have sympathy.

742
00:45:43,340 --> 00:45:45,360
Besides, we're not familiar with the terrain.

743
00:45:46,020 --> 00:45:46,700
Don't worry.

744
00:45:47,740 --> 00:45:50,260
I've already contacted my sworn sister Helen.

745
00:45:50,740 --> 00:45:51,660
She's familiar with the area.

746
00:45:52,040 --> 00:45:53,200
Tieshan has met her before.

747
00:46:25,170 --> 00:46:25,830
Who is it?

748
00:46:26,010 --> 00:46:26,710
Long Zhan.

749
00:46:29,370 --> 00:46:30,170
No one.

750
00:46:31,770 --> 00:46:33,230
Sister Dai Pi, I went to your house.

751
00:46:33,350 --> 00:46:34,050
I didn't find my brother.

752
00:46:43,110 --> 00:46:43,770
Oh no!

753
00:46:44,150 --> 00:46:45,290
He must have gone to find Bao Bo.

754
00:46:45,970 --> 00:46:47,130
Long Zhan, come with me.

755
00:46:53,320 --> 00:46:54,640
I didn't say I'd go with him.

756
00:46:54,920 --> 00:46:55,340
You're a pig.

757
00:46:56,100 --> 00:46:57,220
You don't want to go with me.

758
00:47:03,410 --> 00:47:06,210
Yes, I'll go with you.

759
00:47:06,790 --> 00:47:08,630
Then I'll go with you.

760
00:47:12,570 --> 00:47:15,530
Yes, it's too late to come back to me.

761
00:47:19,510 --> 00:47:22,890
Bao Bo, I'm willing to fight for you.

762
00:47:24,530 --> 00:47:25,890
Whether it's winning or losing,

763
00:47:26,130 --> 00:47:28,670
profit or contract, it's up to you.

764
00:47:30,850 --> 00:47:32,370
I won't let you get away with it.

765
00:47:32,570 --> 00:47:33,510
You can't get involved with my brother.

766
00:47:34,530 --> 00:47:34,990
Nonsense!

767
00:47:35,410 --> 00:47:36,830
I can't lose face for nothing.

768
00:47:37,370 --> 00:47:38,550
I can't die for nothing.

769
00:47:39,010 --> 00:47:40,810
It's too late to say that again.

770
00:47:44,810 --> 00:47:46,330
But you can't deny it.

771
00:47:50,320 --> 00:47:53,080
Your business...

772
00:47:53,080 --> 00:47:54,560
I've made a lot of money for you.

773
00:47:56,960 --> 00:47:58,280
Good for you.

774
00:48:02,320 --> 00:48:04,620
Fine, I'll let you fight for me.

775
00:48:04,800 --> 00:48:06,800
As long as you can beat him.

776
00:48:12,100 --> 00:48:13,420
Just as you said,

777
00:48:14,440 --> 00:48:17,680
profit or contract, it's up to you.

778
00:48:18,860 --> 00:48:21,280
We're still friends.

779
00:48:29,880 --> 00:48:31,820
Thank you.

780
00:48:46,080 --> 00:48:47,520
Be careful.

781
00:48:48,100 --> 00:48:50,280
Your big fist will hurt your head.

782
00:49:02,670 --> 00:49:03,570
Don't worry.

783
00:49:04,090 --> 00:49:06,590
If you lose, you'll have to fight for it.

784
00:49:06,910 --> 00:49:08,010
What's wrong with you?

785
00:49:08,250 --> 00:49:09,090
Fight!

786
00:49:11,950 --> 00:49:13,530
Who are you?

787
00:49:13,530 --> 00:49:15,010
I'm Liang Ming Tian.

788
00:49:21,990 --> 00:49:23,570
Brother Liang, how are you?

789
00:49:23,930 --> 00:49:25,450
Long time no see.

790
00:49:38,040 --> 00:49:39,740
Liang Ming Tian, good for you.

791
00:49:40,700 --> 00:49:43,000
I'll give you the iron fan.

792
00:49:43,160 --> 00:49:45,160
But it's not very useful.

793
00:50:03,420 --> 00:50:05,240
Take him out.

794
00:50:06,140 --> 00:50:07,280
If Liang Ming Tian's men come,

795
00:50:07,280 --> 00:50:08,060
I'll give it to them.

796
00:50:08,060 --> 00:50:10,960
As long as it's not broken, I don't care.

797
00:50:11,320 --> 00:50:32,240
If you need me,

798
00:50:32,240 --> 00:50:33,880
please leave your phone number.

799
00:50:34,140 --> 00:50:35,480
When you hear the sound of the fan,

800
00:50:35,480 --> 00:50:36,960
please put it down.

801
00:50:52,950 --> 00:50:54,570
Luckily, I called Liang Ming Tian

802
00:50:55,670 --> 00:50:57,290
and finally got the bag.

803
00:50:58,610 --> 00:51:00,190
If we hadn't gone so fast,

804
00:51:00,830 --> 00:51:02,390
the iron fan would have been destroyed.

805
00:51:07,260 --> 00:51:08,500
I'll say it again.

806
00:51:08,800 --> 00:51:10,360
I'll go to Helen tomorrow morning.

807
00:51:10,380 --> 00:51:12,080
She'll take you through the jungle.

808
00:51:12,080 --> 00:51:14,440
Once I've taken care of this,

809
00:51:14,440 --> 00:51:16,270
I'll go to Qing Mai to pick you up.

810
00:53:18,300 --> 00:53:19,500
Iron Fan, come up.

811
00:53:19,860 --> 00:53:20,860
We're leaving.

812
00:53:28,800 --> 00:53:30,410
Your brother's head is probably broken.

813
00:53:30,980 --> 00:53:31,760
Help him up.

814
00:53:36,610 --> 00:53:38,550
We're leaving.

815
00:54:09,300 --> 00:54:10,540
Helen, is the route right?

816
00:54:15,200 --> 00:54:15,840
Where's your brother?

817
00:54:19,820 --> 00:57:31,710
I didn't see him.

818
00:57:32,450 --> 00:57:34,370
Why don't you look up?

819
00:59:41,720 --> 00:59:41,740
Go.

820
01:06:28,750 --> 01:10:05,410
Come on, come on, come on

821
01:10:51,260 --> 01:10:53,240
As the chief, how could you do this?

822
01:11:04,340 --> 01:11:08,220
Come on, come on

823
01:11:27,380 --> 01:13:10,960
Come on, come on

824
01:13:16,700 --> 01:13:19,760
Come on, come on

825
01:13:53,580 --> 01:13:56,060
Dai Bi, to put it in your words

826
01:13:56,060 --> 01:13:57,580
This is a jungle

827
01:13:57,580 --> 01:14:00,360
And it's a jungle without borders

828
01:14:00,360 --> 01:14:02,720
Whoever wins will have the right to survive

829
01:14:02,720 --> 01:14:04,860
You used my name to fool Bao Bo

830
01:14:04,860 --> 01:14:06,640
We are even

831
01:14:08,460 --> 01:14:11,600
Brother Liang, don't you always have a bad relationship with Bao Bo?

832
01:14:13,160 --> 01:14:16,800
There are no permanent enemies or friends on the road

833
01:14:17,900 --> 01:14:20,420
I did have a bad relationship with him more than three years ago

834
01:14:20,420 --> 01:14:22,920
But now our relationship is no longer the same

835
01:14:24,100 --> 01:14:26,080
Sometimes I have to use him

836
01:14:26,080 --> 01:14:29,180
To be honest, I still owe him a favor

837
01:14:29,180 --> 01:14:30,340
Listen to me

838
01:14:30,340 --> 01:14:32,700
Are you going to stand on the side of Bao Bo?

839
01:14:33,280 --> 01:14:33,920
You are too much

840
01:14:35,320 --> 01:14:39,100
You don't want to help me?

841
01:14:39,560 --> 01:14:40,540
You are an old man

842
01:14:40,540 --> 01:14:43,000
You should know that what you want is money

843
01:14:43,780 --> 01:14:45,100
You fooled Bao Bo in Bangkok

844
01:14:45,900 --> 01:14:49,020
If you don't have money, I'm afraid it's hard to make a living

845
01:14:49,020 --> 01:14:50,700
Yes, I understand

846
01:14:50,700 --> 01:14:52,880
But I just want to stay in my family

847
01:14:52,880 --> 01:14:54,680
That's why I came to see you

848
01:14:55,360 --> 01:14:57,980
Brother, you are not that easy to be

849
01:14:57,980 --> 01:14:59,800
I'm afraid that someone will call you brother

850
01:14:59,800 --> 01:15:02,440
But I don't like it

851
01:15:02,440 --> 01:15:04,280
I'm not that kind of person

852
01:15:04,280 --> 01:15:05,260
That's good

853
01:15:05,260 --> 01:15:08,720
I have arranged for Hu Tie Shan and Bao Bo to fight again

854
01:15:08,720 --> 01:15:11,560
That's what you owe him on the contract

855
01:15:11,560 --> 01:15:13,640
He gave me money, you gave me people

856
01:15:13,640 --> 01:15:15,480
I took 40% of the security fee

857
01:15:15,880 --> 01:15:17,920
What? So you have already

858
01:15:17,920 --> 01:15:20,400
That's right, Bao Bo is earlier than you

859
01:15:20,400 --> 01:15:23,000
He gave you 600,000 dollars

860
01:15:23,000 --> 01:15:25,320
You know how good he is

861
01:15:25,320 --> 01:15:28,240
At the same time, the security fee is 150,000

862
01:15:28,240 --> 01:15:29,880
It's not a small amount

863
01:15:29,880 --> 01:15:31,800
I have to think about it

864
01:15:31,800 --> 01:15:34,520
